  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The roof of the rear extension hereby approved shall not be used as a terrace, balcony or similar amenity area.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In the interests of neighbours amenities.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Prior to the commencement of works, detailed drawings and full specifications of the proposed green/biodiverse roof shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The submission shall include cross-sectional drawings (scale 1:20) confirming a minimum substrate depth of 80mm (for a Sedum Roof) or 100mm-150mm (for a biodiverse/wildflower roof), excluding the vegetative mat; a planting plan incorporating a diverse mix of species containing a minimum of 25 species for a roof this size, including native species beneficial to local wildlife; and a management and maintenance plan to ensure the long-term success of the green roof. The approved details shall be fully implemented and&amp;nbsp;retained thereafter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Reason:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;In order that the development meets biodiversity requirements and is in accordance with policy LP47 of Hackney&#x27;s LP33.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
